OL,3,AWoman found dead in home named as GP
OL,4,
OL,5,FA woman found dead at her home has been
OL,6,Fnamed locally as a GP.
OL,8,FThe body of Dr Hannah Terry, also known
OL,9,Fas Hannah Cain, was found at a property
OL,10,Fin Fern Hill, Dersingham, Norfolk, on
OL,11,FSunday.
OL,13,FNorfolk Police said it was called to
OL,14,Fthe property by the ambulance service
OL,15,Fjust after 02:20 BST.
OL,17,FA man in his 40s was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of murder and remains in
OL,19,Fcustody.
